1
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:38,080
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:40,940
[Episode 8]

3
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,080
Go, Sun Yi!

4
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:15,960
Wonderful!

5
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,400
Thanks.

6
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,400
The play-in tournament is coming up.

7
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,730
Wanna come back with me?

8
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,840
ook at you,

9
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,320
bringing so many drinks

10
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,140
you can barely carry them all.

11
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,480
Their team trains way too hard.

12
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:10,000
Didn't people from our dorm
have that get-together with their team?

13
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,280
We're friends,
so I'm just looking out for them.

14
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,760
Got it. Go on in.

15
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,560
Okay, next.

16
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,600
Come on.

17
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,840
Okay, next.

18
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:30,680
Come on.

19
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:36,920
-Keep up the pace.
-Good.

20
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,450
Keep up the pace. Keep it up.

21
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,200
Coach.

22
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,200
Take a break.

23
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,320
-Give it to me.
-Senior,

24
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,780
you're really something.

25
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,840
Thanks, Xiangxiang. Let me take that.

26
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,600
Um,

27
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,840
thanks for the juice.

28
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,240
I wasn't the one
who wanted to bring you the drinks.

29
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,960
Xiangxiang insisted.

30
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,120
Xiangxiang,

31
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:11,280
are you two the only ones
from your dorm who came?

32
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,610
Who else did you expect?

33
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,880
Youyou obviously. Who else?

34
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:15,960
No, no.

35
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,399
I-I was just asking.

36
00:04:17,470 --> 00:04:23,020
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

37
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:19,160
Come on, have some drinks.

38
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,360
Here, Coach.

39
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,019
Here you go.

40
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,160
Kong Fang.

41
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,720
Thanks, Xiaotao.

42
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,160
Thanks, junior.

43
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:25,800
Thanks, Xiaotao.

44
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,440
-Thanks, Xiangxiang.
-Good luck in the competition, everyone.

45
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,120
Let's go!

46
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,920
-Thanks.
-Thanks, Xiaotao.

47
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:34,360
Tian, sorry I'm late.

48
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,860
Okay, everyone, let me introduce

49
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,360
our new center.

50
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,280
-Zhou Yunze...
-What's he doing back here?

51
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,120
Why come back after leaving?

52
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,600
You bailed before the regional qualifiers

53
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,880
and we ended up in the play-in.

54
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:49,520
-You've got some nerve coming back!
-How dare he show his face here again?

55
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,640
-Exactly!
-You had the nerve to leave. Stay gone.

56
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:54,840
How do you even have the nerve
to show your face here again?

57
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,760
-What's going on?
-Unbelievable.

58
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,760
Come on, let it go.

59
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,400
What's wrong with them?

60
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,120
Shameless.

61
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,880
It's probably fine.

62
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:05,140
-And now he thinks he can come back.
-What does he even want?

63
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,010
He comes and goes as he pleases.

64
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,770
Well, it's nice to meet you.

65
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,120
Welcome back to the team.

66
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,120
Thank you, Coach.

67
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,840
I'm sorry, everyone.

68
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,320
I was reckless

69
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,480
and let my emotions get the better of me.

70
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,080
What matters is you're back.

71
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,960
Please trust me.

72
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:48,470
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

73
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,560
I'll work hard

74
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,530
to make up for my past mistakes.

75
00:05:56,960 --> 00:05:58,960
All right, that's behind us now.

76
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,480
Let's give it our all!

77
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,390
[Jiangcheng University Basketball Team]

78
00:06:08,640 --> 00:06:09,360
Chen Yu.

79
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,040
One, two, three! Jiangcheng University!

80
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,240
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

81
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:24,560
All right, back to training.

82
00:06:28,440 --> 00:06:29,520
Go get changed.

83
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:31,140
Thanks, Coach.

84
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,000
Come on, over here.

85
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:36,740
Nice shot!

86
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:37,520
Thanks.

87
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:38,600
-Footwork! Watch your footwork.
-Come on, come on.

88
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,820
How many times do I have to tell you?

89
00:06:39,820 --> 00:06:40,640
Take a shot!

90
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,520
Keep up the pace.

91
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,920
I helped bring the drinks too.

92
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,480
-Next.
-Why didn't he thank me?

93
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,040
Pass it to me!

94
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,159
He wasn't thanking me for the drinks.

95
00:06:46,159 --> 00:06:46,960
Hurry, hurry!

96
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:48,020
Come on, over here!

97
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,920
You two have something going on?

98
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,380
Watch your defense! Move!

99
00:06:52,150 --> 00:06:52,830
All right,

100
00:06:52,860 --> 00:06:53,620
next!

101
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,920
I believe

102
00:06:57,980 --> 00:06:59,780
[Documentary Topic: JCU Basketball Team]

103
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,960
JCU Team can return
to its former glory.

104
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:02,160
That's why I want to interview the team.

105
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,960
I think

106
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,930
there's a fundamental problem
with this story idea.

107
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,040
The JCU Basketball Team

108
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,280
is one of the biggest talking points
on campus.

109
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:15,720
We know every player inside out.

110
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,560
We've seen it all before.

111
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,560
So this piece

112
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,260
offers nothing original.

113
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,340
My question is:

114
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,160
what's the appeal?

115
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:27,370
[Jiangcheng University Campus TV Station]

116
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:28,860
[JCU Basketball Team:
Status and Historical Record]

117
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,840
Xiaoyu actually has a point.

118
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,920
JCU Team has a glorious history,

119
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,520
winning eight
university league championships.

120
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:37,380
[JCU Basketball Team:
Status and Historical Record]

121
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,800
Its players

122
00:07:35,800 --> 00:07:37,800
are also well-known around campus.

123
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,440
But there's one thing

124
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,610
we can't ignore:

125
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:41,960
JCU Team

126
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:44,400
might not even make it
to the national tournament this year.

127
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:47,260
The team is facing the worst results
in its history.

128
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,320
I'd like to focus on the period

129
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:49,840
before and after the play-in.

130
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:51,390
[JCU Basketball Team:
Status and Historical Record]

131
00:07:50,450 --> 00:07:51,730
This match

132
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,520
is crucial for them.

133
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,840
It's do or die.

134
00:07:56,159 --> 00:07:57,240
If they lose,

135
00:07:57,280 --> 00:07:58,920
their season is over.

136
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:02,680
From what I've heard,

137
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,480
JCU Team has a new coach

138
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,260
and has welcomed back
a former teammate.

139
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,240
The whole team is fired up

140
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,320
and united,

141
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,560
determined to win.

142
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:19,760
So no matter the outcome,

143
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,560
I believe this piece

144
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,290
will tell a compelling story
of personal growth.

145
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,680
Fang Yu, what do you think?

146
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,640
I don't have anything else to add.

147
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,080
What do you think, Director?

148
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,280
I think it's good.

149
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:41,830
Sure, it's an old story in a new package.

150
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:44,730
[JCU Basketball Team:
Status and Historical Record]

151
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,750
But

152
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:45,320
it really captures the spirit
of Jiangcheng University.

153
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,560
If you do it right,

154
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,560
it'll have both depth and buzz.

155
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,200
Make it a good one.

156
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,880
Thank you, Director.

157
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,000
Youyou,

158
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,920
if you sign with our company,

159
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:08,380
you'll get your own
private livestream studio.

160
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,720
But, Mr. Sun,

161
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,440
I think you've misunderstood my position.

162
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:13,200
I became a beauty blogger
to share what I love.

163
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:15,000
I can't sell products in every livestream

164
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,530
or promote cheap products.

165
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:20,700
By the way,
you're from Jiangcheng University, right?

166
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:21,960
You know Tang Hui,

167
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,680
the manager of your university's

168
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:25,280
basketball team, don't you?

169
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,840
She's the campus belle.

170
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:31,080
-Many companies fought to sign her.
-Our product is really delicious.

171
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,000
And in the end,

172
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:34,120
she chose our company.

173
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:36,400
-Thank you.
-She's got the looks

174
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:38,000
and knows how to play the game.

175
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,960
You could

176
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,440
learn a thing or two from her.

177
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,400
You need to know how things work.

178
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,320
Mr. Sun,

179
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,440
I'm working with you

180
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,760
to grow my career.

181
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:49,200
If you want someone
who just does as they're told,

182
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,280
I'm not the right person.

183
00:09:49,490 --> 00:09:50,150
[Influencer Talent Contract]

184
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,840
Youyou.

185
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:56,080
Youyou, Youyou...

186
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,280
As the saying goes, there's joy
in life's simple pleasures.

187
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,080
Have some more.

188
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,680
It's just one contract that fell through.

189
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,640
Besides, there'll be plenty
of other opportunities.

190
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,500
I think you're absolutely right.

191
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,600
A responsible media professional

192
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,680
has to stay true to their own style.

193
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:12,960
Exactly.

194
00:10:13,770 --> 00:10:15,450
You know what really got me?

195
00:10:15,610 --> 00:10:16,370
He said,

196
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,360
"Look at Tang Hui, the campus belle

197
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,470
and team manager of JCU Team.

198
00:10:19,470 --> 00:10:21,310
She's got the looks

199
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:23,070
and knows how to play the game."

200
00:10:23,570 --> 00:10:25,900
What was that supposed to mean?
That I don't have the looks?

201
00:10:25,900 --> 00:10:27,170
He's talking nonsense.

202
00:10:27,170 --> 00:10:27,920
Besides, the basketball team

203
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,850
doesn't even have a female team manager!

204
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:31,530
I heard someone mention

205
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:33,290
that Tang Hui went abroad to study.

206
00:10:33,290 --> 00:10:34,970
She used to be the team's darling,

207
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:36,980
and she got along great with everyone.

208
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:38,030
And?

209
00:10:38,130 --> 00:10:39,760
I heard she's been neighbors
with Gu Han

210
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,390
since they were kids.

211
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:43,210
She often practiced with Gu Han,

212
00:10:43,590 --> 00:10:44,950
and when he got injured,

213
00:10:45,290 --> 00:10:46,370
she was

214
00:10:46,390 --> 00:10:48,390
always there to take care of him.

215
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,960
Well, she's the team manager.

216
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,440
It's perfectly normal

217
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,360
for her to train with the players

218
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,490
and help them recover from injuries.

219
00:10:57,490 --> 00:10:59,450
Exactly, exactly. It's perfectly normal.

220
00:10:59,450 --> 00:11:01,450
People are making way too much of it.

221
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:02,980
Forget about that Tang Hui.

222
00:11:02,980 --> 00:11:03,780
Anyway,

223
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:06,440
there's no way
she's prettier than me, right?

224
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:07,240
Of course not!

225
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,060
Youyou, you're the prettiest!

226
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:10,490
Youyou, you're the prettiest!

227
00:11:10,490 --> 00:11:11,650
Eat up, Xiangxiang.

228
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,360
I'm so mad!

229
00:11:13,410 --> 00:11:15,010
I was too angry to eat all day.

230
00:11:25,410 --> 00:11:26,530
Thanks for talking

231
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:27,280
to Coach Pei

232
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:29,520
and getting him to let me
film this documentary.

233
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:31,120
Then do a good job filming it.

234
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,840
You have to come watch it when I'm done.

235
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,480
Sure.

236
00:11:35,330 --> 00:11:35,930
By the way,

237
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,960
is the team getting a new recruit?

238
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,000
Zhou Yunze?

239
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,440
Not a player.

240
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:43,880
Not a player?

241
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:46,760
Then that's beyond my scope.

242
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:51,150
I mean... staff.

243
00:11:53,330 --> 00:11:54,530
I've no idea about it.

244
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:57,420
What does that have to do
with your documentary?

245
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:04,230
Didn't I promise

246
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:06,480
to treat you to a meal
if we came in first?

247
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,880
We never got around to it.

248
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,020
Are you hungry now?

249
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,080
Right now?

250
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:12,800
Let's go.

251
00:12:12,990 --> 00:12:13,550
Let's go.

252
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:24,400
Let's play

253
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:26,010
the flower poetry game.

254
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,110
What's that?

255
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,680
It's simple. We take turns
reciting lines of poetry

256
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:31,960
that contain the word "flower."

257
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:35,360
But each time, "flower" has to move
one position to the right.

258
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,360
For example,

259
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:39,680
"Flowers by the tower
stir a traveler's sorrow."

260
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:41,560
In this line, "flower"
is the first word, right?

261
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:42,640
Then you may say,

262
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:45,120
"When flowers fall, we meet again."

263
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,920
Now "flower" is the second word.

264
00:12:51,110 --> 00:12:51,870
Let's do it.

265
00:12:51,890 --> 00:12:52,650
You go first.

266
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,560
"Flowers by the tower
stir a traveler's sorrow."

267
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:00,360
That's a foul!

268
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,840
I just said that line.
You can't repeat it.

269
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:04,380
You never said that was a rule.

270
00:13:04,380 --> 00:13:05,460
Well, it is now.

271
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:07,420
Come on, I'll have a drink with you.

272
00:13:15,080 --> 00:13:16,440
My turn, my turn.

273
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,960
"When flowers fall, we meet again."

274
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,020
You're repeating it too!

275
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:25,680
I said that line,
so it doesn't count as a repeat.

276
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:32,640
"Just like a flower, her face glows red."

277
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,280
That's the fourth word.

278
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:35,240
You got it wrong.

279
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,940
Fine, fine. I'll have another drink
with you, okay?

280
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:58,360
Seriously?

281
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:00,820
Two drinks and you're already drunk?

282
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:10,240
Hey, let me ask you,

283
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:12,880
is a female team manager

284
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:14,720
coming back to your team?

285
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,890
You're such a lightweight.

286
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,520
Can't hold your liquor?

287
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,200
Don't touch me.

288
00:14:26,550 --> 00:14:27,710
I'm fine.

289
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:36,840
Senior,

290
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,360
I'm sorry.

291
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:41,100
I didn't mean to get you into trouble.

292
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,880
I just wanted to ask you...

293
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:46,920
Ask me what?

294
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:05,560
[Inzone Garland Selection Hotel]

295
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,200
Senior,

296
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:12,800
you brought

297
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,360
your ID, right?

298
00:15:24,190 --> 00:15:25,920
Where are we going?

299
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,680
Slow down, slow down.

300
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:34,840
Water...

301
00:15:35,510 --> 00:15:37,150
Give me some water.

302
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,800
Water...

303
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,280
I don't want water.

304
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,730
I need to do my homework.

305
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,280
Hurry up.

306
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,940
We used to do homework together
all the time.

307
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:52,920
Could he have mistaken me
for his childhood sweetheart?

308
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,880
Hurry up, hurry up.

309
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,040
Okay, okay.

310
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:58,120
Before we start our homework,

311
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,760
how about I quiz you on something?

312
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:02,200
Math or Chinese?

313
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,380
This one would be history.

314
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:06,440
History? Sure, history is okay.

315
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,720
Have you had a girl

316
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:12,200
you've really liked since you were little?

317
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:15,920
Yeah.

318
00:16:16,880 --> 00:16:17,640
Who?

319
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,120
You.

320
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:37,560
You, too.

321
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:41,880
I like you so much.

322
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:47,370
Have fun by yourself. I'm leaving.

323
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:49,680
Wait,

324
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,940
we haven't done our homework yet.

325
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,760
I don't think we've done our homework.

326
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:59,520
Okay, let's do our homework
on the bed, okay?

327
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,640
I'll do it myself.

328
00:17:01,800 --> 00:17:03,480
I'll do it myself.

329
00:17:04,780 --> 00:17:05,960
I tried my best.

330
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:07,960
You have to ask me...

331
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:36,240
♪ Time circles round, going nowhere ♪

332
00:17:37,530 --> 00:17:41,500
♪ We once met, then passed each other by ♪

333
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:50,720
♪ Eyes closed, memories quietly unfold ♪

334
00:17:52,010 --> 00:17:57,890
♪ Every story will unfold♪

335
00:17:59,190 --> 00:18:05,200
♪ I look up again,
the sleepless stars in sight ♪

336
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:10,280
♪ So this is what it means to miss you ♪

337
00:18:11,120 --> 00:18:19,490
♪ I want you to say those words at last ♪

338
00:18:20,390 --> 00:18:24,900
♪ Love means being with you ♪

339
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:28,240
♪ I love you ♪

340
00:18:28,730 --> 00:18:32,130
♪ I miss you ♪

341
00:18:33,090 --> 00:18:40,050
♪ The me who met you that day
belongs to long, long ago ♪

342
00:18:40,290 --> 00:18:43,470
♪ Across the sea of time ♪

343
00:18:43,530 --> 00:18:48,130
♪ Reunited,
love finds its sweetest scene ♪

344
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:46,680
H-How did I end up sleeping here?

345
00:20:56,240 --> 00:20:58,240
So you finally decided to come back?

346
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:00,720
I'm sorry.

347
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:03,870
Last night,
I went to the campus TV station

348
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:06,640
to watch them edit the documentary.

349
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:09,160
Oh, please.

350
00:21:09,160 --> 00:21:10,920
We called the campus TV station yesterday.

351
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,980
You weren't there.

352
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,200
Where are they?

353
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,940
Don't change the subject.

354
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,000
Tell me the truth.

355
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:22,720
Look at you, Zhou Xiangxiang!

356
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,360
Staying out all night
without even telling us.

357
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:26,120
Do you know how worried we were?

358
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:27,960
We went out looking for you
in the middle of the night.

359
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,800
We called and messaged you,
but you never replied.

360
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:32,600
Where were you having so much fun
that you forgot all about coming home?

361
00:21:32,600 --> 00:21:35,040
I took Gu Han to the small hotel
by the west gate.

362
00:21:35,040 --> 00:21:37,300
My phone died, so I didn't get your calls.

363
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:39,840
B-But it's not

364
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,360
what you think.

365
00:21:41,360 --> 00:21:42,600
He was drunk.

366
00:21:43,880 --> 00:21:45,400
He was drunk,

367
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:47,450
and you didn't come back all night?

368
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,720
Zhou Xiangxiang,

369
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:52,440
don't tell me you took advantage of him!

370
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,440
No...

371
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:56,480
I-I did get him drunk,

372
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:58,040
but it's not what you think.

373
00:21:58,040 --> 00:21:59,840
I've been worried sick
about you all night,

374
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:01,440
and you're still keeping secrets from me!

375
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:02,280
You don't even like him,

376
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:03,920
yet you got him drunk
and took him to a hotel room?

377
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,520
Fine! I like him, okay?

378
00:22:09,520 --> 00:22:11,240
-That's not what I—
-Finally got you to admit it!

379
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:13,160
I'm calling the girls right now.

380
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:13,800
No, no, no.

381
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:14,360
Xiaotao, don't!

382
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:15,160
Girls,

383
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:17,000
to celebrate Xiangxiang's big confession,

384
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,400
we're meeting at the Second Cafeteria
for lunch today!

385
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,760
Be there or be square.

386
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:47,240
Why did I wake up
in that little hotel this morning?

387
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,760
You were so drunk,

388
00:22:52,760 --> 00:22:54,520
and you were so heavy.

389
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:56,450
How was I supposed to carry you?

390
00:22:56,840 --> 00:22:58,480
So you took me to the hotel?

391
00:22:59,240 --> 00:23:00,970
Don't get the wrong idea, okay?

392
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:02,720
I just got you onto the bed,

393
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:03,840
then I left.

394
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:04,680
And then?

395
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:11,600
A-And then...

396
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:14,200
nothing.

397
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:15,170
Are you sure?

398
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:19,080
This is the library.

399
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:21,160
Are you going to study or not?

400
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:32,920
He was drunk.

401
00:24:32,920 --> 00:24:35,180
He probably doesn't remember anything.

402
00:24:48,360 --> 00:24:54,340
[Selected Chinese Historical Prose,
Volume I]

403
00:24:57,160 --> 00:24:57,880
Xiaotao.

404
00:24:59,440 --> 00:25:01,320
Senior. What's up?

405
00:25:01,320 --> 00:25:02,040
Have a seat.

406
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:05,120
Their desserts are amazing.

407
00:25:05,120 --> 00:25:06,450
I wanted you to try them.

408
00:25:06,760 --> 00:25:07,800
Thanks, Senior.

409
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:08,840
Their drinks

410
00:25:08,840 --> 00:25:09,680
are pretty good, too.

411
00:25:09,680 --> 00:25:11,040
Why don't you try one?

412
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:15,440
I'll have a "Sweet Sorrow," then.

413
00:25:15,440 --> 00:25:17,520
Sure! Excuse me,

414
00:25:17,520 --> 00:25:18,240
one—

415
00:25:20,320 --> 00:25:21,640
Are you MissueLe Xiaotao?

416
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:23,100
Here's your Sweet Sorrow.

417
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:24,280
For me?

418
00:25:24,280 --> 00:25:25,000
Yes.

419
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,080
But I didn't order this.

420
00:25:27,080 --> 00:25:28,520
Your friend ordered it
especially for you.

421
00:25:28,520 --> 00:25:29,480
They just called to say

422
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,680
you'd arrived

423
00:25:30,680 --> 00:25:32,000
and wanted to surprise you.

424
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:32,520
Enjoy.

425
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:33,480
Thanks.

426
00:25:35,360 --> 00:25:36,720
A friend...

427
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,520
Well—

428
00:25:43,520 --> 00:25:44,920
Actually, I don't want this anymore.

429
00:25:44,920 --> 00:25:46,520
We'll have a coconut latte instead.

430
00:25:46,520 --> 00:25:47,320
Sure.

431
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:48,520
Excuse me, could you—

432
00:25:49,080 --> 00:25:51,010
Hello, here's your coconut latte.

433
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:52,720
Is this one for me, too?

434
00:25:52,720 --> 00:25:53,440
Yes.

435
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:54,920
Wait.

436
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:58,320
Was it a guy or a girl?
Do you have their number?

437
00:25:58,320 --> 00:25:59,800
Sorry, it was a guy.

438
00:25:59,800 --> 00:26:00,720
He didn't say who he was,

439
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:03,120
and we don't have
his number on file. Enjoy.

440
00:26:15,920 --> 00:26:17,520
That's a little suspicious.

441
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,480
It's okay, Senior.

442
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,740
Let's just enjoy them.

443
00:26:19,760 --> 00:26:20,440
Okay.

444
00:26:20,520 --> 00:26:23,540
[New Ice Rink]

445
00:26:22,280 --> 00:26:23,810
Try this. It's really good.

446
00:26:24,960 --> 00:26:26,000
Wow, this is delicious!

447
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:26,810
Told you.

448
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:30,680
This drink is great, too.

449
00:26:30,280 --> 00:26:32,070
[New Ice Rink]

450
00:26:30,800 --> 00:26:31,520
Thanks, Senior.

451
00:26:31,520 --> 00:26:33,200
It's no big deal. If you like it,

452
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:34,480
I'll bring you here again.

453
00:26:33,620 --> 00:26:35,300
[Water World Anime Expo Makes Its Debut
on the 19th of This Month]

454
00:26:39,810 --> 00:26:41,630
[Li Sirui]

455
00:26:45,010 --> 00:26:46,960
[Li Sirui]

456
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:05,600
Do you want to come with me tomorrow...

457
00:27:12,920 --> 00:27:14,160
Do you want to go

458
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,000
to the new water park with me

459
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:16,860
and a few of the players tomorrow?

460
00:27:20,490 --> 00:27:23,850
[Li Sirui]

461
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:26,720
Do you want to go

462
00:27:26,720 --> 00:27:27,600
to the new water park with me

463
00:27:27,600 --> 00:27:29,460
and a few of the players tomorrow?

464
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:33,600
Zhou Yunze can't make it,

465
00:27:34,040 --> 00:27:36,170
so we have an extra ticket. Wanna come?

466
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:40,200
Just admit you're jealous.

467
00:27:49,040 --> 00:27:50,050
[I've been pretty busy lately.]

468
00:27:58,240 --> 00:27:59,320
But I guess

469
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:01,450
I can make some time to go with you guys.

470
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:03,640
Yes!

471
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:07,580
[Jiangcheng University
Sports and Cultural Center]

472
00:28:07,710 --> 00:28:10,110
[Every inch of longing pierces the heart;
this Love is hard to erase]

473
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,360
The director's pulling this trick again,

474
00:28:41,360 --> 00:28:43,600
cutting off right
at the most crucial moment.

475
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:45,000
So, shall we keep going?

476
00:28:45,800 --> 00:28:48,680
I must see my favorite couple
get their happy ending.

477
00:28:48,680 --> 00:28:50,880
Must be nice to have your homework done.

478
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:07,520
Still here?

479
00:29:09,600 --> 00:29:10,840
What are you writing?

480
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:15,560
"The ends of the earth have their limits;

481
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:19,520
only longing knows no end."

482
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,400
Who's the love letter for?

483
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,120
Homework.

484
00:29:27,240 --> 00:29:28,840
Your homework is cheesy love poetry?

485
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:30,370
Then why don't you write it?

486
00:29:33,080 --> 00:29:35,340
You're not leaving until it's finished.

487
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:38,880
I'll leave a great poet like you
to find inspiration.

488
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:40,920
A mere mortal like me won't disturb you.

489
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:41,640
I'll be off.

490
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:45,040
"The ends of the earth have their limits."

491
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:54,120
The lecturer was right all along.

492
00:29:54,920 --> 00:29:56,960
Only genuine feelings

493
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:59,920
can make inspiration flow.

494
00:29:58,060 --> 00:30:00,550
[Untitled]

495
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:05,280
Xiangxiang, how's your writing
coming along?

496
00:30:09,800 --> 00:30:11,930
I'm not feeling very inspired either.

497
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:13,880
Let me see.

498
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:16,720
Zhou Xiangxiang, are you even human?

499
00:30:16,720 --> 00:30:18,000
You've written so much!

500
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,100
Let me take a look!

501
00:30:19,160 --> 00:30:20,440
I'm not done yet.

502
00:30:20,530 --> 00:30:22,920
Are you writing a love letter
to Gu Han or what?

503
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:24,560
Why all the secrecy?

504
00:30:27,360 --> 00:30:30,290
Speaking of which,
you've written so much for Gu Han.

505
00:30:30,440 --> 00:30:32,640
Do you think Gu Han has feelings for you?

506
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:35,560
Why not put him to the test?

507
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:36,720
How?

508
00:30:37,920 --> 00:30:40,280
I saw a post online the other day

509
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,760
about how to tell

510
00:30:41,760 --> 00:30:43,920
if a guy has feelings for you.

511
00:30:44,040 --> 00:30:46,440
Every time you part ways,

512
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,880
if he can't bear to leave

513
00:30:47,920 --> 00:30:49,720
and keeps turning back to look at you

514
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,160
until you're out of sight,

515
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,620
he's definitely into you.

516
00:30:54,760 --> 00:30:57,160
Xiangxiang, you should try it with Gu Han.

517
00:30:57,600 --> 00:30:59,930
Youyou, you could try it
with Chen Yu, too.

518
00:31:00,080 --> 00:31:01,360
What does that have to do with me?

519
00:31:01,360 --> 00:31:03,120
Chen Yu was even asking me

520
00:31:03,120 --> 00:31:04,680
about you the other day.

521
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:10,000
How much of your homework have you done?

522
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:11,360
It's so hard.

523
00:31:11,250 --> 00:31:15,560
[Jiangcheng University]

524
00:31:28,280 --> 00:31:29,080
Pass the ball!

525
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:30,320
Chen Yu.

526
00:31:33,100 --> 00:31:33,700
Pass it.

527
00:31:36,840 --> 00:31:37,480
Chen Yu!

528
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:43,340
Chen Yu, what's going on with you?

529
00:31:43,370 --> 00:31:44,640
Why didn't you pass it?

530
00:31:44,960 --> 00:31:45,960
I don't trust him.

531
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,290
What was that? Speak up!

532
00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:49,680
I don't trust him.

533
00:31:50,520 --> 00:31:52,080
He thinks he can just come back
whenever he wants?

534
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:53,810
Can we get back the game we lost?

535
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:54,640
Chen Yu,

536
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,960
I understand why you don't trust me.

537
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:00,830
Last time, I left the team
without permission

538
00:32:00,830 --> 00:32:02,830
and failed to act like a team player.

539
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,200
That was my fault.

540
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:05,840
I'm sorry.

541
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:14,800
Chen Yu,

542
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:17,100
I know it's hard to trust someone,

543
00:32:17,360 --> 00:32:18,720
but we're a team now.

544
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:21,320
If we want to win,
we have to remember that.

545
00:32:21,320 --> 00:32:22,040
Otherwise,

546
00:32:22,600 --> 00:32:25,460
we might as well break up the team
right here and now.

547
00:32:35,320 --> 00:32:36,780
All right, let's go again.

548
00:32:38,720 --> 00:32:39,440
It's okay.

549
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:41,410
Everyone, keep playing your best.

550
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:46,220
Chen Yu, pass the ball.

551
00:32:51,110 --> 00:32:52,720
Good, one more! One more!

552
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:55,970
Chen Yu is pretty blunt.

553
00:32:56,360 --> 00:32:57,840
Find a chance to talk to him.

554
00:32:57,840 --> 00:32:58,960
We don't have any more time

555
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,090
for trial and error.

556
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,280
I understand.

557
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:06,370
